{"availability":"available","full":"IdanAr/CV-Builder","name":"CV-Builder","description":"AI-Driven Résumé & ATS Optimization Platform","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-07T19:39:13Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:24:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://cv-builder-indol-zeta.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://cv-builder-indol-zeta.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.550Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.550Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.550Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.550Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Build resumes that beat ATS parsers and impress humans - then track every application from a spreadsheet-style board, or let the platform find and pre-tailor new matches for you automatically.","CVitae Studio is a full-stack, AI-assisted resume platform for job seekers who need their CVs to pass Applicant Tracking System (ATS) filters and look polished to human eyes - and who then need somewhere to track every application they send out, or a way to have new matching openings found and pre-tailored for them. Career data is authored once against the JSON Resume v1.0.0 standard, decoupled from a separate design/meta tree, so switching templates never touches the underlying facts."],"features":["Dual-track, dual-mode export - a Designed PDF (one of five visual templates, or DOCX via native paragraph styles) for humans, and a plain-text ATS-safe PDF mode for parsers, selected per export.","Generate → Critique → Refine AI pipeline - every AI draft (bullet points, summaries, ATS rewrites, cover letters) is critiqued by a second pass before it reaches the user, and any invented number or skill is flagged for…","Real-time ATS scoring with one-click auto-fix - paste a job description, get a 0-100 score across four vectors, then let AI rewrite the weak sections directly against the missing keywords.","AI-generated, hallucination-guarded cover letters, tailored to a job description and generated from the same resume facts.","A job-application tracking supertable - an Airtable/Notion-style grid with a Kanban board view, custom columns, multi-column sort, filters, drag-and-drop, and a per-row activity log - to manage every resume version you…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IdanAr/CV-Builder/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8f004407f630d359b46dde5317ab97bd613a53640bdb956feefcd1ea7360a690","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.744Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.744Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Build resumes that beat ATS parsers and impress humans - then track every application from a spreadsheet-style board, or let the platform find and pre-tailor new matches for you automatically.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IdanAr/CV-Builder/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Marketing, sign-in and legal pages use the same tokens; the marketing hero keeps its Plasma background and marquee.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IdanAr/CV-Builder/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Each provider must explicitly allow the production callback, or sign-in fails after the user authorizes - the provider rejects the redirecturi it was handed:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IdanAr/CV-Builder/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"8f004407f630d359b46dde5317ab97bd613a53640bdb956feefcd1ea7360a690","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IdanAr/CV-Builder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.745Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T08:24:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IdanAr/CV-Builder/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T11:05:46.748Z","hash":"8f004407f630d359b46dde5317ab97bd613a53640bdb956feefcd1ea7360a690","originalBytes":49015,"storedBytes":